2. ZCode / Z.ai (Apache-2.0) - observed behaviour, not copied source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sign-in and quota polling talk to the ZCode authorization relay at
https://zcode.z.ai. That relay, its endpoint paths, its header names and its
response envelope are an undocumented third-party contract observed from
ZCode (https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode, Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Z.AI
Co., Ltd) and rebuilt here. No ZCode source file is copied into this
project.

Note that the relay mints tokens under ZCode's own client identity. This
project is NOT authored by, affiliated with, or endorsed by Z.AI / Zhipu.
Using it may conflict with the Z.ai terms of service, and Z.ai may revoke
access at any time. Every relay origin is a configurable setting precisely
so that the dependency can be repointed or removed.

